{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've just arrived at the scene following an urgent report\u2014<br>and time is not on your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have <strong>1 hour</strong>.<br>Talk to the suspects. Examine the evidence. Uncover what\u2019s been hidden beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re part of the <strong>Initial Response Investigation Team</strong>.<br>You may not be able to expose everything, but with the <strong>right clues and the right questions</strong>, deduction is still possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think a suspect is lying?<br>Send the evidence for analysis, then interrogate them again.<br>They might just crack under the pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heard something suspicious from one suspect?<br>Bring it up with another. Push the conversation.<br>Guide the dialogue to dig deeper and uncover new statements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How far can you go?</strong><br>If you push all the way, the truth will reveal itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game for those who've only ever relied on what they could see.<br>Can you solve a case based solely on testimonies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Give it a try. We dare you.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3748110?t=1749535383","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3748110?t=1749535383","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748110/34e418149a3e99af6754c524e7bba7a48da94ffc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749535383","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748110/34e418149a3e99af6754c524e7bba7a48da94ffc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749535383","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've just arrived at the scene following an urgent report\u2014<br>and time is not on your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have <strong>1 hour</strong>.<br>Talk to the suspects. Examine the evidence. Uncover what\u2019s been hidden beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re part of the <strong>Initial Response Investigation Team</strong>.<br>You may not be able to expose everything, but with the <strong>right clues and the right questions</strong>, deduction is still possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think a suspect is lying?<br>Send the evidence for analysis, then interrogate them again.<br>They might just crack under the pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heard something suspicious from one suspect?<br>Bring it up with another. Push the conversation.<br>Guide the dialogue to dig deeper and uncover new statements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How far can you go?</strong><br>If you push all the way, the truth will reveal itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game for those who've only ever relied on what they could see.<br>Can you solve a case based solely on testimonies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Give it a try. We dare you.</strong></p>","developers":["leeroom shin"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748110/ad17a75f1c9c84f977d7120ae4e2cd05da9021e9/header.jpg?t=1749535383","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 or later<br></li><l